<title>POLAND: Swarzedz sees PLN 4.4 mln net loss in 97.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz sees PLN 4.4 mln net loss in 97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish furniture maker Swarzedz SA is forecast to suffer a 4.4 million zloty loss this year on sales of 167.9 million zlotys, PAP news agency quoted the firm's president Julian Nuckowski as saying on Friday.</p>
<p>In 1996, Swarzedz had 53.9 million zloty loss on sales of 107 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
